{
  "job_B9.2.4_20251003_114951": {
    "chunk_text": "cedemonie \u00fea hwile \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Persa cyning benom \u00feone ealdormon his scire, \u00fee \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6m fri\u00fee anfeng \u00e6t & hie sendon to Egyptum L\u00e6cedemonie, & him fultumes b\u00e6don; & hie him gesealdon an C \u00feara L\u00e6cedemonie h\u00e6fdon him to ladteowe \u00e6nne wisne mon, \u00feeh he healt w\u00e6re, se w\u00e6s haten Hie si\u00fe\u00fean on \u00f0\u00e6m s\u00e6 tog\u00e6dere foran, & \u00fe\u00e6r swa ungemetlice gefuhton \u00fe\u00e6t hie neah ealle \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 L\u00e6cedemonia anweald & heora dom alegen. Ne wene ic, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6nige twegen latteowas emnar gefuhten. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Conon gel\u00e6dde fierd eft on L\u00e6cedemonie, & \u00f0\u00e6t land buton \u00fe\u00e6re byrig on \u00e6lcon Pissandor hatte sum L\u00e6cedemonia latteow: he gesohte Conon mid scipun, \u00fea he of \u00de\u00e6r wurdon L\u00e6cedemonie swa swi\u00f0e forslagen \u00fe\u00e6t hie na\u00feer n\u00e6fdon si\u00fe\u00fean ne heora namon ne Ac heora hryre wear\u00f0 Ahtenum to ar\u00e6rnesse \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00f0one ealdan teonan gewrecan mehten \u00fee him & hie & Thebane hie gegaderedon, & L\u00e6cedemonie mid gefeohte sohton, & hie gefliemdon, & hie \u00dea burgware sendon \u00fea \u00e6fter Iesulause, \u00fee mid heora here w\u00e6s in Asiam, & b\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t hie tidlice & swa gedydon & on Ahtene ungearwe becoman & hie gefliemdon. Ahteniense w\u00e6ron \u00fea him swi\u00f0e ondr\u00e6dende",
